{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118186","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118186/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118186/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118186/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118186","id":4205004083,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7P9cT6","number":118186,"title":"GDScript: Use linked list for instance tracking.","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-04-04T13:59:28Z","updated_at":"2026-04-10T15:41:36Z","closed_at":"2026-04-10T15:38:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118186","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118186","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118186.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118186.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-10T15:38:25Z"},"body":"Each `GDScript` does bookkeeping about its instances, this is primarily used for hot reloading purposes (but #118191 requires it in prod builds).\r\n\r\nAt the moment this is done using an `RBSet`, however this becomes a bottleneck when instancing a lot of objects. The only case for searching in the set was the implementation of `Script::instance_has` which is not used internally and can be implemented by just looking at the passed object. So we don't need efficient searching and can use a linked list (`SelfList`) to get O(1) insertion and deletion.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Benchmarked using this script</summary>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nclass Test extends Object:\r\n\tpass\r\n\r\nconst RUNS = 50\r\nconst OBJ_COUNT = 100_000\r\n\r\n# Called when the node enters the scene tree for the first time.\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tseed(\"El psy kongroo\".hash())\r\n\tvar t = Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tfor run in range(RUNS):\r\n\t\tvar instances: Array[Object] = []\r\n\t\tfor i in range(OBJ_COUNT):\r\n\t\t\tinstances.append(Test.new())\r\n\t\tinstances.shuffle()\r\n\t\tfor i in instances:\r\n\t\t\ti.free()\r\n\tprint (Time.get_ticks_msec() - t)\r\n\tget_tree().quit(0)\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nI'm seeing almost a 40% increase in performance with this change. I also checked `HashSet` just in case, and while it outperforms `RBSet` it is still slower than the linked list approach.\r\n\r\nDatesheet: [self_list.ods](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26481037/self_list.ods)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nOnly downside: this adds 32bytes to each `GDScriptInstance`, but this seems like a fine tradeoff to me. We could get it down to 16bytes by not using `SelfList` and implementing this manually, directly on `GDScriptInstance`. Which would remove the self pointer and the list pointer (each instance has a pointer to its script).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI also noticed some code, which seems to handle the case that the `instances` member contains placeholder instances. But based on the current code only objects with `GDScriptInstance`s are added, so I removed that part.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118186/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":5,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118186/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}